@page
@model HydroSentinel.Pages.HowItWorksModel
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "How HydroSentinel Works"; }

<div class="page-redesign how-page">
    <section class="rd-hero" aria-labelledby="how-title"><div class="shell rd-hero-grid"><div><p class="rd-kicker">Simple steps. Smarter water.</p><h1 id="how-title">How It Works</h1><p class="rd-hero-lede">HydroSentinel is designed to help people understand and manage their water-pumping system with a clearer view of the equipment, information, and decisions that matter.</p><a class="button button-primary" asp-page="/Product">Explore HydroSentinel <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="rd-hero-media"><img src="~/images/connected monitoring.jfif" alt="Industrial pump-room scene with a person reviewing information on a phone" width="2132" height="1200" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"/></div></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section" aria-labelledby="steps-title"><div class="shell"><div class="rd-section-head"><div><p class="rd-kicker">The process</p><h2 id="steps-title">Three stages, clearly separated.</h2></div><p>Move from the physical installation to the intended monitoring experience. Pairing and live telemetry are not implemented in this website.</p></div><div class="rd-timeline"><article class="rd-timeline-item"><div class="rd-timeline-no">01</div><img src="~/images/Smart Water System Installation.png" alt="HydroSentinel controller beside a blue water tank and pump" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy"/><div class="rd-timeline-copy"><h3>Connect your controller</h3><p>Have the controller installed and connected to the pump and tank according to approved product installation instructions. This page does not provide electrical installation instructions.</p></div></article><article class="rd-timeline-item"><div class="rd-timeline-no">02</div><img src="~/images/Smart Water System Monitoring App.png" alt="Illustrative smartphone interface for monitoring a water system" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy"/><div class="rd-timeline-copy"><h3>Set up your account</h3><p>Create an account and register a device through the intended HydroSentinel website workflow when that service is available. The image is illustrative.</p></div></article><article class="rd-timeline-item"><div class="rd-timeline-no">03</div><img src="~/images/Water Management Dashboard Workspace.png" alt="Illustrative laptop and smartphone water-management dashboard" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"/><div class="rd-timeline-copy"><h3>Monitor your system</h3><p>Use the intended dashboard experience to review system information, status details, and alerts. The screens shown are not live telemetry.</p></div></article></div></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section rd-section-soft" aria-labelledby="system-title"><div class="shell"><div class="rd-section-head"><div><p class="rd-kicker">System overview</p><h2 id="system-title">A conceptual line of sight.</h2></div><p>This is a relationship model, not a wiring diagram or communication specification.</p></div><div class="rd-flow"><div class="rd-flow-item"><strong>Water source</strong><span>Tank or storage</span></div><div class="rd-flow-item"><strong>Pump</strong><span>Water movement</span></div><div class="rd-flow-item"><strong>HydroSentinel</strong><span>Controller layer</span></div><div class="rd-flow-item"><strong>User view</strong><span>Intended monitoring interface</span></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section"><div class="shell rd-editorial"><div><p class="rd-kicker">What it helps you see</p><h2>Useful information for everyday decisions.</h2><p>The intended capability areas focus on awareness, protection, and more informed water-system management.</p></div><div class="rd-rule-list"><div class="rd-rule"><strong>01</strong><div><h3>Monitoring</h3><p>Keep relevant water-level and pump-status information easier to review.</p></div></div><div class="rd-rule"><strong>02</strong><div><h3>Protection</h3><p>Notice conditions that may need attention sooner.</p></div></div><div class="rd-rule"><strong>03</strong><div><h3>Management</h3><p>Use visibility to support more thoughtful water decisions.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section-dark"><div class="shell rd-cta-row"><div><p class="rd-kicker">Next step</p><h2>Ready to get started?</h2></div><div class="rd-actions"><a class="button button-light" asp-page="/Product">View Product</a><a class="button button-light-outline" asp-page="/Contact">Contact Firmlon</a></div></div></section>
</div>
